flowchart LR
    Human[Human passkey] --> Ceremony[Exact origin and RP ceremony]
    Ceremony --> Session[Opaque bounded session]
    Agent[System or AI workload token] --> Credential[Expiring scoped credential]
    Session --> Authority[Current principal and policy]
    Credential --> Authority
    Authority --> Gate[Action and enrollment and signal checks]
    Gate --> Query[Scoped source selection and evidence]
    Query --> Recheck[Publication-time authority recheck]
    Recheck --> Answer[Bounded no-store answer]
    Gate --> Intent[Durable mutation intent]
    Intent --> Control[Spindle control publication]
    Control --> Audit[Durable outcome audit]
    Host[Stopped service and host custody] --> Recovery[Protected owner recovery]
    Recovery --> Epoch[New credential epoch]
    Epoch --> Authority
    Spindle[Separate Spindle credential] --> Intake[Durable intake and config polling]
